# After Hours design context

Before touching marketing UI, `(marketing)/**` copy, or `globals.css` token changes that affect the After Hours brand:

1. Read `DESIGN.md` (Overview + Brand direction).
2. Read `docs/styles/after-hours-direction.md` in full — including the **Experience** section (metaphor system, voice, landing choreography, anti-patterns).

Runtime truth is `src/app/globals.css`; implementation recipes are in `docs/styles/style-guide.md`. Do not restate the vibe here or in code comments — the docs above are the single source.
